{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/extras/TRET-description-header_about-EN.png?t=1742829738\" /><strong>Step into the neon-lit world of TRET, where skill, strategy, and fast-paced action collide in a high-stakes game show like no other!</strong> The city is alive with glowing lights, towering skyscrapers, and an audience that never blinks\u2014watching, waiting, anticipating your next move. Every challenger steps onto the grand stage, but only the most daring will conquer its trials. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/extras/GIF1.gif?t=1742829738\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate dynamic arenas, outmaneuver deadly hazards, and guide the synthball to victory. But this is no ordinary challenge\u2014each level is a new puzzle, a fresh test of reflexes and problem-solving, set against the electrifying pulse of a synthwave soundtrack. Are you ready to take the stage?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/extras/TRET-description-header_features-EN.png?t=1742829738\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/extras/GIF2.gif?t=1742829738\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>A Hybrid Action-Puzzler</strong> \u2013 Each level is a blend of physics-based puzzles, movement challenges, and strategic thinking. Speed across platforms, dodge lasers, and use your environment to manipulate the synthball\u2019s path to success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>25 Unique Levels, Each a New Challenge</strong> \u2013 Wall-run, leap through moving obstacles, and outsmart the ever-changing arenas. No two levels are the same, and each will test your mastery in new ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>A Thrilling Synthwave Spectacle</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a world where neon never fades, the city pulses with electric energy, and the soundtrack is a relentless wave of retro-futuristic beats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Compete for Glory</strong> \u2013 Whether you're chasing the perfect run or aiming for the top of the global leaderboards, TRET is built for those who love the thrill of competition.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/extras/GIF3.gif?t=1742829738\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>The lights are on, the stage is set,\u00a0the challenge begins now!</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2492610?t=1742829738","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742829738","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/797511580743db9f149586d7b0556b2a94748bf0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742829738","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/797511580743db9f149586d7b0556b2a94748bf0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742829738","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/extras/TRET-description-header_about-EN.png?t=1742829738\" /><strong