tacle</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a world where neon never fades, the city pulses with electric energy, and the soundtrack is a relentless wave of retro-futuristic beats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Compete for Glory</strong> \u2013 Whether you're chasing the perfect run or aiming for the top of the global leaderboards, TRET is built for those who love the thrill of competition.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/extras/GIF3.gif?t=1742829738\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>The lights are on, the stage is set,\u00a0the challenge begins now!</i></strong></p>","developers":["Golden Acorn"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/header.jpg?t=1742829738","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Golden Acorn - All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117949,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117949/movie480.mp4?t=1742826713","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117949/movie_max.mp4?t=1742826713"},"name":"TRET | Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117949/5c04c7db05c57e8f291ef4eb688f1198840f9cd6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742826713","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117949/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742826713","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117